WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.659 --> 00:00:04.740
Where I come from?

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:07.009
I’m not connected to one place

00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:09.540
but my connection to all places is:

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:13.540
wherever I go, I keep asking questions.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.040
as a little boy I was the one getting on the
nerves

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.160
of the teachers, my parents and my friends

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:20.510
by asking “Why?

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:21.510
Why?

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:22.510
Why?”

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:24.910
This little boy is now a journalist

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:26.679
and keeps doing one thing

00:00:26.679 --> 00:00:28.939
asking questions.

00:00:28.939 --> 00:00:31.470
My work takes me every day to the Arab region.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:35.040
I see a lot of potential and energy in the
younger generation.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:37.440
They raise their voice for issues they care
for

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:39.390
but is anyone listening?

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:42.120
Why aren’t they part of the political decisions?

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:44.420
Why can’t they be who they want to be?

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:46.770
And why are they not able to speak freely

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.670
about everything they care for?

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:52.129
That’s why I want to give the younger generation
a platform

00:00:52.129 --> 00:00:54.000
to express themselves freely,

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.280
be who they want to be

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:57.000
and raise their questions.

